<title>USA: J.C. Nichols hires investment advisor.</title>
<headline>J.C. Nichols hires investment advisor.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, Mo. 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>J.C. Nichols Co, a real estate firm, said Monday it hired Morgan Stanley &amp; Co Inc to assist it in implementing its long-term capital plan.</p>
<p>&quot;As we continue to identify development opportunities and expand our commitment to this region, we want to (ensure) implementation of a capital plan which facilitates our development and acquisition goals,&quot; Barrett Brady, president, said in a statement.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
